flowchart TD
    A[Authorized merchant member chooses provider and operation] --> B[Show exact permissions, costs, data use and fallback]
    B --> C[Create single-use tenant-bound OAuth transaction]
    C --> D[Official provider authorization in system browser]
    D --> E[Validate state, PKCE, issuer, redirect, expiry and current authority]
    E --> F[Server exchanges code and discovers actual assets/scopes]
    F --> G[Merchant selects exact business asset and routing]
    G --> H[Test webhook and granted capabilities]
    H --> I{Tests and policy eligibility pass?}
    I -->|No| J[Keep disabled; explain correction or direct-link fallback]
    I -->|Yes| K[Encrypt credential and activate verified capabilities]
    K --> L[Monitor token, webhook, policy, cost and account health]
    L --> M{Pause, revoke, policy loss or disconnect?}
    M -->|Pause| N[Stop automation; preserve allowed human path]
    M -->|Revoke or disconnect| O[Stop actions, revoke upstream, remove secret and reconcile retained data]
    M -->|No| L
